      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This problem also occurs with 3-point tracking.\nThis misalignment seems to be linked to locomotion animation.\nIf the legs are short or long in relation to the length of the hands, the position is further shifted up or down. (Very uncomfortable).\nIt was cured in IKBeta before PhysBone came along, but this problem has reappeared as if we are back to where we were before IKbeta was applied.",
